OL,3,GNEWSAApplication to use site to store
OL,4,Aindustrial waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added that the 5,574 sq m (59,998 sq
OL,7,Fft) site, which is located north of the
OL,8,Fhousehold waste and recycling centre,
OL,9,Fis currently used by the government for
OL,10,Fthe temporary storage of waste cooling
OL,11,Fequipment.
